    <h2>Getting to the parks</h2>
    <p>The Skyliner is the big advantage here. Caribbean Beach is a Skyliner hub, with lines to EPCOT (via the Riviera station), Hollywood Studios, and the shared Pop Century / Art of Animation station. Buses cover Magic Kingdom, Animal Kingdom, the water parks and Disney Springs. Official pages say the Skyliner will close for routine refurbishment January 24 through 30, 2027, and January 24 through February 2, 2028, with complimentary buses filling in.</p>
