  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Centertown Market</strong> is the main quick-service restaurant, in the Old Port Royale / Centertown area.</li>
      <li><strong>Spyglass Grill</strong> is a second quick-service spot, useful if you are staying in a village farther from Centertown.</li>
      <li><strong>Sebastian's Bistro</strong> is the table-service restaurant.</li>
      <li><strong>Banana Cabana</strong> is the pool bar at Fuentes del Morro Pool.</li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app at the quick-service spots.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival.</li>
    </ul>
    <span class="ryan">[Ryan: your go-to meal here, and one thing you'd skip.]</span>
