  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Fuentes del Morro Pool</strong> is the main pool, themed like a colonial Spanish fortress, with zero-depth entry. Official pages describe two waterslides, including one 102 feet long, a shipwreck play area (for guests 48 inches or under), and a 12-person spa. Banana Cabana is next to this pool.</li>
      <li><strong>Five leisure pools</strong>, one in each village, are the quieter option.</li>
      <li>Towels are free at the pools. Hours and lifeguard coverage vary and can change.</li>
    </ul>
